{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/circleci/postgres","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:18:51.082Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/circleci/postgres/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/circleci/postgres"},"readme":"Experimental CircleCI images for PostgreSQL.\n\nExtends the official image of [PostgreSQL](https://dockerhub.com/_/postgres) to be friendly to use in CircleCI for testing.\n\nThe following is the customizations CircleCI applies in a `Dockerfile`:\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM postgres:latest\nENV POSTGRES_DB=circle_test\n```\n\nAiming to have CircleCI extended images ease adoption of Docker and CircleCI.  Once users are successful, we encourage users to build and customize their images to suite their individual project needs.\n\n# Experimental\n\nCircleCI is experimenting with this service image and we may change it in future in an incompatible way.  Users should consider building their own image or locking the image digest in CircleCI configuration files.\n\n# User Feedback\n\n## Issues\n\nIf you have any problems with or questions about this image, please contact us on [CircleCI Discuss Forum](https://discuss.circleci.com/c/ecosystem/circleci-images).","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"circleci","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/circleci","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2017-03-27T16:02:50.357893Z","updated":"2021-12-18T00:17:52.12949Z","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":null,"links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":510183264,"stars":35},"mediaTypes":["application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json"],"contentTypes":["image"],"storage":766146900060,"tags":[{"name":"latest","digest":null,"pushed":"2021-09-27T15:16:10.606904Z","size":135757308,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","status":"active"},{"name":"9-bullseye-ram","digest":null,"pushed":"2021-12-18T00:17:51.834178Z","size":84859961,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaTy